    /// - `slot_size` — N bytes per slot, a [`CACHE_LINE_SIZE`]
    ///   multiple.
    /// - `capacity` — M slots, a power of two from 1 to `2^30`.
    /// - The region must be [`CACHE_LINE_SIZE`]-aligned and at
    ///   least [`mpsc_region_size`] bytes.

